  "version": 1,
  "rules_applied": "Precedence, first match wins. (1) non_grappling: name starts with 'UFC' or 'NCAA' -- these are MMA/wrestling cards and carry no grappling ruleset (analysis/discipline.py ADR-05); the one exception is the named override 'UFC BJJ 4', a UFC-hosted pure-grappling card. (2) adcc: contains 'adcc'. (3) cji: contains 'cji' or 'combat jiu-jitsu'. (4) ibjjf: contains 'ibjjf', or is one of the IBJJF-run championship names listed in MANUAL_OVERRIDES -- the promotion's own championships ('World No-Gi 2024', 'Pan No-Gi 2025', 'European No-Gi 2024') do not carry the letters IBJJF and a keyword cannot reach them. (5) other: every remaining named event -- a residual, NOT a ruleset. (6) unknown: NULL/empty event (career dumps carry no event name, so no ruleset).",
