      "preset": "adcc-worlds-current-2026-08-13",
      "captured_on": "2026-08-25",
      "note": "Takedown ending guard/half-guard 2, sweep 2, passing the guard 3, back mount with hooks 3, mount 2, knee-on-belly 2; negative -1 for pulling guard / fleeing during the negative phase. The 4-point takedown-that-passes and every negative are unrepresentable here: the first needs a landing position the event carries no field for, the second needs the match clock."
    }
